    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[ Be siblegerum.] [Ld] ⁊ æt syblegerum þa witan geræddan, þæt cyng ah þone uferan ⁊ bisceop þone nyþeran, butan hit man gebete for Gode ⁊ for worulde, be þam þe seo dæd sy, swa bisceop getæce.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And in the case of incestuous unions, the councillors have decided that the king shall take possession of the male offender, and the bishop the female offender, unless they make compensation before God and the world as the bishop shall prescribe, in accordance with the gravity of the offence.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ æt siblegerum ða witan geræddan, þæt cyng ah ðone yferan ⁊ bisceop ðæne nyðeran, buton hit man gebete for Gode ⁊ for worulde, be ðam ðe seo dæd sy, swa bisceop getæce.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
